SweepFees_Concrete_Test
├── when no fees are pending
│   └── it should revert
└── when fees are pending
    ├── when the transfer to the fee recipient fails
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the transfer succeeds
        ├── it should send every pending fee to the fee recipient, whoever calls
        ├── it should clear the pending fees
        └── it should emit {FeesSwept}
